Source: halos-desktop
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Matti Airas <matti.airas@hatlabs.fi>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/halos-org/halos-metapackages
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: halos-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         halos,
         halos-desktop-wallpaper,
         halos-browser-trust
Description: HaLOS desktop variant metapackage
 This metapackage marks a HaLOS installation as a desktop variant.
 Pulls in a HaLOS-branded default wallpaper via the virtual package
 halos-desktop-wallpaper, satisfied by either halos-desktop-branding
 (generic) or halos-halpi-desktop-branding (HALPI2).
 .
 Also pulls in halos-browser-trust so the on-device browser trusts the
 device's own CA (the system p11-kit trust store) with no manual steps.
